{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1202612-holy-blood-holy-essence-the-heretical-children-of-the-immaculate-dragons","id":1202612,"title":"Holy Blood, Holy Essence; The (Heretical) Children of the Immaculate Dragons","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-03T09:07:10-07:00","id":1202612,"title":"Holy Blood, Holy Essence; The (Heretical) Children of the Immaculate Dragons","content":"According to the Immaculate Order, the Dragons have no children. <br /> <br /> To the commoners, this is taught: although born as flesh and blood, the Elemental Dragons essence was too pure and profound to intermingle with that of humanity, not even of the other Dragon-Blooded. Although they may have taken lovers (in particular, Sextes Jyles and Daana'd), these unions were incapable of being fruitful. And as they were spirtually related, it would have been incestous for the Immaculate Dragons to lay with one another.<br /> <br /> To most dynasts and mortal lay members, this is taught: the Immaculate Dragons bore and sired children, because *of course they did*. However, those lineages were lost and ended after the Great Uprising, the intercine fighting of the Shogunate, and the disaster of the Contagion. Anyone who now claims the heritage of the Immaculate Dragons is, at best, deluded, and more likely a heretic or charlatan.<br /> <br /> According to the Immaculate Order, the Immaculate Dragons have no children.<br /> <br /> But I tell you this; it is not so.<br /> <br /> The children of the Immaculate Dragons live. The Immaculate Order both knows this, and covertly alters records and carefully watches these few bloodlines. I have proof- &quot;Writ Upon Water&quot;, letters from Daana'd to her lover, describing their childrens' features and listing them by name, deemed false by the Mouth of Peace four hundred years ago- but still kept in secret vaults! &quot;The Forest After Flame&quot;, which *explicitly* names the daughter of Sextes Jyles and Hesiesh as the first Shogun. And more- kept in private libraries and forgotten monestaries! I've spent a lifetime collecting them, and on more than one occusion dodging assassins- yes, paid killers! -sent by the Immaculate Order itself to keep this knowledge secret!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T09:12:59-07:00","id":1202615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wastevens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1202612-holy-blood-holy-essence-the-heretical-children-of-the-immaculate-dragons#post1202612\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> &quot;The Forest After Flame&quot;, which *explicitly* names the daughter of Sextes Jyles a